# filgħodu, "in the morning", the adverb that fixes a spoken hour in the AM
# half ("Fis-sebgħa nieqes għaxar filgħodu"), and CLDR's bare AM.  This is a
# clock marker, not a daypart band: CLDR ships no dayPeriodRuleSet for mt, so
# this locale ships no band boundaries at all.  en.wiktionary.org, filgħodu;
# languagephrases.com, "Telling Time In Maltese Language"; Unicode CLDR 47, mt
# ca-gregorian.json, dayPeriods.format.wide.
filgħodu
am
